# Send only the travel runtime and its reviewed build inputs to Docker.
**
!server/
!server/**
!design/
!design/travel-live/
!design/travel-live/**
!deploy/
!deploy/travel/
!deploy/travel/**
!tools/
!tools/windows/
!tools/windows/mcp-compat/
!tools/windows/mcp-compat/**

# Keep all machine-private state out, including inside otherwise allowed trees.
**/.git
**/private
**/private/**
**/state
**/state/**
**/node_modules
**/node_modules/**
**/build
**/build/**
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*cookies*.json
**/private-*.json
**/*.keystore
**/*.log
